{"year":"2026","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 32nd edition, the first under the name <i>The Actor Awards</i>, took place on March 1, 2026, at the Shrine Auditorium in Los Angeles, hosted by <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 40462, 'screen_type': person}\">Kristen Bell</a> for the third time and streamed live on <i>Netflix</i>. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1233413, 'screen_type': movie}\">Sinners</a> (2025) won the cast award, and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 135651, 'screen_type': person}\">Michael B. Jordan</a> was named best actor for his dual role as the twins Smoke and Stack. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1054867, 'screen_type': movie}\">One Battle After Another</a> (2025), which won the supporting actor award with <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 2228, 'screen_type': person}\">Sean Penn</a>, became, alongside <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1934, 'screen_type': movie}\">Shakespeare in Love</a> (1998), one of only two films nominated in every film category it was eligible for. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 3, 'screen_type': person}\">Harrison Ford</a> received the lifetime achievement award. <i>Television awards are not included.</i>"},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":1233413,"name":"Sinners","image_path":"/v0Ljeti537c6cNKweuEN0iaU3x4.jpg","director":"Ryan Coogler","winner":true,"backdrop_path":"/nAxGnGHOsfzufThz20zgmRwKur3.jpg"},{"type":"movie","id":1062722,"name":"Frankenstein","image_path":"/rB0tZwNImTT8febX5qVycZ5YVeF.jpg","director":"Guillermo del Toro","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":858024,"name":"Hamnet","image_path":"/njatIGrIlZCxB88UUBC2xgmfCNE.jpg","director":"Chloé Zhao","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":1317288,"name":"Marty Supreme","image_path":"/oLWBW1Sg9V8KGgbR3Y8jeEWF2Gi.jpg","director":"Josh Safdie","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":1054867,"name":"One Battle After Another","image_path":"/2peYXW6CoruehDnKJGMjl2NuaNB.jpg","director":"Paul Thomas Anderson","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Actress","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":1498158,"name":"Jessie Buckley","image_path":"/qbz9175DERSqsCQeYWGJWwqb38z.jpg","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":858024,"name":"Hamnet","image_path":"/njatIGrIlZCxB88UUBC2xgmfCNE.jpg","director":"Chloé Zhao","backdrop_path":"/73BClq9FOcrWrutnpiqhCNEWEwJ.jpg"}},{"type":"person","id":9827,"name":"Rose Byrne","image_path":"/wR8YZlrewVW2FixRBrJcxaXU3R1.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":1160360,"name":"If I Had Legs I'd Kick You","image_path":"/rKmfPaOx1V2gPK9gJj5Fdg4UI44.jpg","director":"Mary Bronstein"}},{"type":"person","id":11661,"name":"Kate Hudson","image_path":"/s79lH1QzEg2fkXULKBxRmU9aNr8.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":1371185,"name":"Song Sung Blue","image_path":"/zRtwTGqMbgv2PaTSAMg0R3qfUO4.jpg","director":"Craig Brewer"}},{"type":"person","id":3914706,"name":"Chase Infiniti","image_path":"/2goENGgg9OCz7qjMmm0HNxV9Kjj.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":1054867,"name":"One Battle After Another","image_path":"/2peYXW6CoruehDnKJGMjl2NuaNB.jpg","director":"Paul Thomas Anderson"}},{"type":"person","id":54693,"name":"Emma Stone","image_path":"/mstXxlDqhoK0s0molsNpskJ1wLH.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":701387,"name":"Bugonia","image_path":"/6OeJbx1QGDwrlL8SPZeLKjLhhA7.jpg","director":"Yorgos Lanthimos"}}]},{"type":"video","video_id":"JKCdolHEoGg","information":{"contentTitle":"The SAG Awards are renamed The Actor Awards (official announcement)","source":"YouTube: <i>Netflix</i> channel"}},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Actor","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":135651,"name":"Michael B. Jordan","image_path":"/sMBpav8cK7t7Nk0yf4tuNOqNUyW.jpg","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":1233413,"name":"Sinners","image_path":"/v0Ljeti537c6cNKweuEN0iaU3x4.jpg","director":"Ryan Coogler","backdrop_path":"/nAxGnGHOsfzufThz20zg